  "summary": "As a 6x Certified NetSuite Techno-Functional Lead with over 14 years\nof experience, I specialize in architecting and delivering scalable ERP\nsolutions that streamline financial and operational processes across\nglobal organizations. I have successfully led 50+ end-to-end NetSuite\nimplementations across manufacturing and wholesale distribution,\ncovering all major modules—Finance, Procure-to-Pay (P2P), Order-to-\nCash (O2C), Record-to-Report (R2R), and Taxation—with a proven\ntrack record of enhancing efficiency through automation, data integrity,\nand system integration.\nMy expertise spans solution design, configuration, SuiteFlow\nautomation, integration architecture, and UAT/SIT leadership, ensuring\nseamless deployments & strong post-go-live success. I’m passionate about\nbuilding automated, data-driven environments using SuiteAnalytics\nWorkbooks, custom reports, & dashboards to deliver real-time financial\nvisibility, ensure compliance, & accelerate financial close cycles.\nA hands-on project leader, I have guided cross-functional teams and\ncoordinated with global resources to deliver projects on time and within\nbudget. Skilled in client discovery, solution design, and collaborating with\nFinance and Operations leaders to build scalable, data-driven solutions,\nI also develop dashboards, analytics, and training that drive user\nadoption, improve financial visibility, and strengthen internal controls.\nBeyond implementation, I contribute to solution architecture, pre-sales\nconsulting, and team mentoring, promoting best practices and\ncontinuous improvement. My leadership in regional consulting (India,\nMiddle East, SE Asia) has delivered measurable business outcomes—40%\nclient expansion and 60% revenue uplift—through quality, collaboration,\nand innovation.\n\nPrincipal Consultant\nOracle Solution Services",
